<PolicyPage
  title="Privacy Policy — Sunny & Ranney"
  description="How Sunny & Ranney, the Roswell, GA home store of Sunshine On A Ranney Day, collects, uses and protects your information, including our text messages."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="November 8, 2026"
>
  <p class="policy__intro">
    Sunny &amp; Ranney is a home furnishings store at 109A Oak Street in Roswell, Georgia. It is operated by
    <strong>Sunshine On A Ranney Day Incorporated</strong>, a nonprofit, and every purchase supports its work. This policy
    explains what information we collect through sunnyandranney.com, our store and our text messages, and how we use it.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email sign-ups:</strong> your email address when you join our list.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Online orders:</strong> checkout is run by Shopify, which collects your name, shipping address, email and
        payment details. We receive your order details; we never see your full card number.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Messages to us:</strong> anything you send by email, phone or our website's chat assistant.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Employee information:</strong> for our own staff, the details we need to schedule and pay them, including a
        mobile number if they choose to get work schedule texts (see <a href="#text-messages">Text messages</a>).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Technical data:</strong> like any website, our hosting provider records basic details such as your IP address
        and browser to keep the site running and secure.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To fill your orders, answer your questions and run the store.</li>
      <li>To send our emails, if you signed up. Every email has an unsubscribe link.</li>
      <li>To schedule our staff and send them their work schedules.</li>
      <li>To keep the site secure and working.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How we share it</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong> We share it only with the companies that help us run the
      store, and only for that purpose: Shopify (checkout and orders), Kit (our email list), Cloudflare (website hosting and
      the chat assistant) and our text message provider. We may also share information when the law requires it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="text-messages">
    <h2>Text messages</h2>
    <p>
      Sunny &amp; Ranney sends text messages only to <strong>our own employees</strong>, about their work schedule. We do not
      text customers or the public, and this website never asks visitors for a phone number.
    </p>
    <h3>How employees sign up</h3>
    <p>
      An employee gives their mobile number to the store manager and agrees in writing to receive work schedule texts. The
      manager adds the number to our staff system, and the first text confirms the sign-up.
    </p>
    <h3>What you'll get</h3>
    <p>
      Your shifts when the store manager publishes a week's schedule, and a new text if your shifts change. That is usually
      one or two texts a week. Message and data rates may apply. We never send marketing texts.
    </p>
    <h3>Stopping and help</h3>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any text to stop. You'll get one confirmation and no more texts. Reply
      <strong>START</strong> to sign up again. For help, reply <strong>HELP</strong>, call
      <a href="tel:6788885140">678.888.5140</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@sunnyandranney.com">info@sunnyandranney.com</a>.
    </p>
    <h3>Your number stays private</h3>
    <p>
      We do not sell or share your mobile number, text messaging opt-in data or consent with third parties.
      <strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional
      purposes.</strong> We share it only with the provider that delivers our texts and the mobile carriers, so the
      messages can reach you. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
    <p>
      We use a small cookie to show how many items are in your cart, and your browser's storage to remember your cart, items
      you've viewed and your chat with our assistant. We do not use advertising trackers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Security and how long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      We protect your information with reasonable safeguards and keep it only as long as we need it to run the store, pay our
      staff and meet our legal obligations.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Our website is not meant for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can unsubscribe from our emails at any time, and stop texts by replying STOP. To see, correct or delete the
      information we have about you, email <a href="mailto:info@sunnyandranney.com">info@sunnyandranney.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy, we'll post the new version here and update the date at the top.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      Sunny &amp; Ranney, 109A Oak Street, Roswell, GA 30075<br />
      <a href="tel:6788885140">678.888.5140</a> · <a href="mailto:info@sunnyandranney.com">info@sunnyandranney.com</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      Operated by Sunshine On A Ranney Day Incorporated, 250 Hembree Park Drive, Roswell, GA 30076 ·
      <a href="https://sunshineonaranneyday.com">sunshineonaranneyday.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyPage>
